同士、\n力を合わせてまいりましょう。","welcome":"私の名は毛利元就。\n……戦は謀が全て。知恵無き戦に勝利はありません。\n乱世に苦しむ民を救うため、謀神と名高き\nこの頭脳を……貴方に貸してさしあげましょう。","raw":{"CardID":7705,"ClassID":10100,"Rarity":6,"CardCategory":5,"VoiceID":4002,"AreaType":8,"GainableYakumodama":60,"FavoriteThings":2,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":116,"AttackCorrection":116,"DefenseCorrection":116,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":16,"GrowUpLimitType":1001,"AbilityID":7705,"OrganizedAbilityID":7705,"AlwaysAbilityID":7705,"GimmickID":7705,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"ExclusionVote":1,"DependenceCardId":7706,"AutoProtect":1,"Sequence":300}}